  "_comment": [
    "A page Decision and a mapping Decision, in the shape the propose path files",
    "them (`raw`) and the shape the read path hands the card (`resolved`).",
    "Both bodies name their data by id: a page block is bound to a database and to",
    "columns, a mapping names a column per incoming source column. The ids that are",
    "not slugs are uuids — every column added through add_column mints one, so this",
    "is the common case — and the card used to render them as \"8f3d2b41…\".",
    "Values are neutral stand-ins for a real proposal; the shapes are not."
